  "bodyHtml": "\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-image-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-title-date no-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Thursday Open Painting Sessions</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tecset-date\"><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">January 17, 2030 @ 1:00 pm</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-date-end\">January 19, 2030 @ 3:30 pm</span></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-light-bg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-content-area\">\n\t\t   \t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>Every Thursday afternoon of the year Guild artists gather informally to paint what they want in a supportive venue. The sessions are <strong>free and open to the public</strong>. Just bring your paints, brushes and subject matter. This is a proven means to learn more about Guild events and our community.  We meet in the Harwich Community Center (except when the Center is closed) located at 100 Oak Street, Harwich 02645. <img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7459\" src=\"/media/archive/d48a94900ca301339c3d38d26586a74117024a4a9fe0f9d96c855fd28a05c161.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-map-area\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-venue-map\">\n\t\n<p data-fidelity-note=\"embed\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyDNsicAsP6-VuGtAb1O9riI3oc_NOb7IOU&amp;q=100+Oak+Street+Harwich+MA+02645+United+States+&amp;zoom=10\">Google maps iframe displaying the address to Harwich Community Center</a></p>\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-area\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-meta-group tribe-events-meta-gro